      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Let it be registered on behalf of the office of supervision,</li>\n<li>if God wills.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">They have registered the amount of two, a half, a quarter and a sixth.&nbsp;</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Praise be to God for his bounties.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">In the name of God, the merciful and compassionate.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">A valid receipt has been granted to \u02beAb\u016b al-\u1e24asan ibn Wahb for the sum owed through his standing surety for the estates in the town of al-Fayy\u016bm</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">for the year four-hundred and three, under the supervision of the auspicious, rightly-guided judge, \u1e6eiqat al-Mulk</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Mak\u012bn al-Dawla wa-\u02beAm\u012bnuh\u0101, the prot&eacute;g&eacute; of the commander of the faithful, \u02beAb\u016b al-\u1e24asan \u02bfAli ibn Bah\u0101r,&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">with \u02beAb\u016b al-Sar\u012b Theodor ibn Yu\u1e25annis acting as accountant.&nbsp;</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Half of this: One, a quarter and a sixth. Its amount: Two, a half, a quarter and a&nbsp; sixth.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Written by M\u012b\u1e35\u0101\u02be\u012bl ibn \u02bfAbd al-Mas\u012b\u1e25, the cashier. Valid. The middle of \u1e0e\u016b al-Qa\u02bfda</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">in the year four-hundred and three.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
